# 42. TENANT ISOLATION

Deployment must preserve all existing multi-tenant security.

Verify:

```text
Tenant A
   X
Tenant B database records
```

Test:

* API
* UI
* documents
* reports
* analytics
* AI
* background jobs
* exports
* files
* search

No cross-tenant leakage.

---

# 43. AUTHENTICATION SECURITY

Production-style DEV must not weaken authentication.

Verify:

* JWT security
* token expiration
* refresh token handling
* password hashing
* secure cookies where used
* CSRF protection where applicable
* CORS
* rate limiting
* login throttling
* session management
* logout
* password reset
* account lockout policy

Never disable security simply because this is DEV.

---

# 44. CORS

CORS must be environment-specific.

Do not use:

```text
allow_origins=["*"]
```

for authenticated production-style deployment unless there is a clearly justified architecture.

Configure:

```env
CORS_ORIGINS=https://dev.axontimehr.com
```

---

# 45. SECURITY HEADERS

Configure appropriate headers such as:

```text
Content-Security-Policy
X-Content-Type-Options
X-Frame-Options
Referrer-Policy
Strict-Transport-Security
Permissions-Policy
```

Tune them according to actual application requirements.

Do not break legitimate frontend functionality.

