# 46. LOGGING

Implement structured application logging.

Logs should identify:

* timestamp
* service
* log level
* request ID
* tenant context where safe
* user ID where safe
* operation
* duration
* error details

Never log:

* passwords
* JWT tokens
* refresh tokens
* API keys
* secrets
* full sensitive employee data

