# 47. REQUEST CORRELATION

Implement a request ID.

Example:

```text
X-Request-ID
```

Flow:

```text
Browser
   |
request-id
   |
Reverse Proxy
   |
FastAPI
   |
Celery
```

This should make debugging production-like DEV issues easier.

---

# 48. ERROR HANDLING

Production-style deployment must not expose stack traces to users.

Development logging may contain detailed stack traces internally.

API should return controlled responses:

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "An internal error occurred.",
  "request_id": "..."
}
```

Do not expose:

* SQL statements
* secrets
* internal filesystem paths
* credentials

