# 49. OBSERVABILITY

Prepare:

```text
Health
Metrics
Logs
Errors
```

At minimum implement:

```text
/health
/ready
```

Prepare architecture for:

```text
Prometheus
Grafana
OpenTelemetry
Sentry
```

without making them mandatory unless already part of the repository.

