# 51. EMAIL

Review email architecture.

Development environment should not accidentally send real HR emails.

Create a safe DEV strategy:

```text
EMAIL_MODE=console
```

or:

```text
EMAIL_MODE=development
```

or a sandbox SMTP provider.

Development notifications should preferably go to a safe test destination.

