# 155. FINAL DEFINITION OF DONE

Phase 14 is COMPLETE only when all of the following are true:

* [ ] Existing AxonTimeHR codebase was inspected before modification
* [ ] Existing Phases 1–13 remain functional
* [ ] Frontend is containerized
* [ ] FastAPI backend is containerized
* [ ] PostgreSQL is containerized
* [ ] Redis is containerized
* [ ] Celery worker is containerized
* [ ] Celery Beat is configured if required
* [ ] Persistent PostgreSQL storage exists
* [ ] Database name defaults to `axontimehr`
* [ ] Database migrations work
* [ ] Demo seed data works
* [ ] Reverse proxy works
* [ ] HTTPS works
* [ ] Domain is configurable
* [ ] Local Docker development works
* [ ] Remote Linux DEV deployment works
* [ ] PostgreSQL is not unnecessarily exposed publicly
* [ ] Redis is not publicly exposed
* [ ] Secrets are not committed
* [ ] `.env.example` exists
* [ ] CI pipeline works
* [ ] Backend tests work
* [ ] Frontend tests work
* [ ] Docker build works
* [ ] Security scanning works
* [ ] Docker images can be published
* [ ] GitHub Actions can deploy DEV
* [ ] Deployment locking exists
* [ ] Database migration executes safely
* [ ] Post-deployment health checks work
* [ ] Smoke tests work
* [ ] Rollback strategy exists
* [ ] Database backup exists
* [ ] Database restore procedure exists
* [ ] Logging works
* [ ] Health endpoint works
* [ ] Readiness endpoint works
* [ ] Resource monitoring/documentation exists
* [ ] Troubleshooting documentation exists
* [ ] Upgrade documentation exists
* [ ] Open-source contribution documentation exists
* [ ] Security policy exists
* [ ] License strategy is documented
* [ ] No production/real employee data exists in repository
* [ ] No secrets exist in repository
* [ ] No hardcoded production credentials exist
* [ ] No cross-tenant data leakage is introduced
* [ ] DEV and production configuration are separated
* [ ] Application can survive container restart
* [ ] Database data survives container restart
* [ ] A new developer can reproduce the environment
* [ ] The application is accessible through the configured DEV domain
* [ ] Final end-to-end deployment has been verified

