# FINAL INSTRUCTION

Do not simply generate configuration files and claim Phase 14 is complete.

Actually inspect the existing AxonTimeHR project and integrate the deployment architecture into it.

The final goal is:

```text
                AXONTIMEHR
                     |
              GitHub Repository
                     |
              GitHub Actions
                     |
             Docker Container Images
                     |
                DEV SERVER
                     |
          +----------+----------+
          |                     |
       HTTPS                  HTTPS
          |                     |
       Frontend               API
                                |
                    +-----------+-----------+
                    |                       |
                PostgreSQL               Redis
                    |                       |
              Persistent Data           Celery
```

The developer should be able to:

```text
write code
    ↓
git push
    ↓
GitHub
    ↓
automated CI
    ↓
automated Docker build
    ↓
automated DEV deployment
    ↓
open browser
    ↓
use live AxonTimeHR
    ↓
create/update data
    ↓
data persists in PostgreSQL
```

This is the primary success criterion for **PHASE 14**.
